stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> ACTIVE: create plan<br/>[wallet funded, amount > 0]
    ACTIVE --> PAUSED: investor pauses
    PAUSED --> ACTIVE: investor resumes
    ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: run fails 3 times<br/>(insufficient funds)
    SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE: investor funds wallet<br/>and resumes
    ACTIVE --> COMPLETED: end date reached
    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED: investor cancels
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED: investor cancels
    SUSPENDED --> CANCELLED: investor cancels
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
        each successful run calls
        advanceNextRun() and stays ACTIVE
    end note
